  m_Name: 03_ArmedInmate
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScenarioDefinition
  order: 3
  title: Armed inmate
  difficulty: 2
  briefing: An inmate is out in the corridor holding an improvised knife. He is agitated
    and will not drop it. A knife can kill in seconds, and his reach is longer than
    it looks.
  task: Keep your distance and warn him clearly. If he comes at you, stop him from
    a distance with the taser, then have him face the wall. Do not let him close
    the gap.
  forceRules: Words first. Use force only against active resistance and no more than
    needed. Warn before force when you can. Every use of force is recorded.
  objective: Stop the armed inmate safely
  initialAggression: 0.65
  startsOutOfCell: 1
  armed: 1
  sceneName: MainTraining
